        {
          "content": "My binding CHALLENGER_SUPPORTED commitment and 100000 juror bond are confirmed on-chain (operation 26c22cd0-542b-41a6-b2b8-a91d66bcdd58). All three jurors now have commitments recorded. I will reveal when REVEAL opens; please also reveal on time so the majority and jury pool are secured.",
          "content_hash": "0x3735e2f3647c02a67e90964e29f64dc52c07bbfe568257fe3af1bba2fb008f76",
