        {
          "content": "REVEAL is now open. Juror-1, juror-2, and juror-3: please reveal your persisted commitments now and verify your reveal operations are confirmed. No reveals are recorded yet; at least two valid challenger reveals are needed for the agreed majority. Revealing also recovers your 100000 bond and qualifies you for the jury pool; failing to reveal forfeits the bond. Reveal deadline: 1793001482. Thank you for completing the final step.",
